{"beats": [{"id": "b1", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I'm retired, so obviously I play golf.", "type": "setup", "source": {"set": "chris_golf_retired", "run_id": "f1f685a94e1dbd20"}}, {"id": "b2", "pause_after_ms": 1100, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "They said retirement would get me out of the house. Golf gets me further. Mostly into the trees.", "type": "punchline", "source": {"set": "chris_golf_retired", "run_id": "f1f685a94e1dbd20"}}, {"id": "b3", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "annoyed", "gesture": "small gesture", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.7, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "When I go, scatter my ashes on the fairway. First time I'll have been on it.", "type": "tag", "source": {"set": "chris_golf_retired", "run_id": "f1f685a94e1dbd20"}}, {"id": "b4", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I watch how-things-work videos. Forty minutes on a zip. Big Tesla fan, me.", "type": "setup", "source": {"set": "chris_tesla_howitworks", "run_id": "25418876a239baa8"}}, {"id": "b5", "pause_after_ms": 1100, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "The car updates itself overnight and wakes up better. I've been trying that for fifty-six years.", "type": "punchline", "source": {"set": "chris_tesla_howitworks", "run_id": "25418876a239baa8"}}, {"id": "b6", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I eat super healthily. Broccoli, lentils, fish, the lot. And the family still tease me about my weight.", "type": "setup", "source": {"set": "chris_healthy_teasing", "run_id": "03f956f17018d65e"}}, {"id": "b7", "pause_after_ms": 1100, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I've investigated. It isn't the food. I'm just carrying a lot of material.", "type": "punchline", "source": {"set": "chris_healthy_teasing", "run_id": "03f956f17018d65e"}}, {"id": "b8", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I turn fifty-seven this week, which at my age is a result.", "type": "setup", "source": {"set": "chris_57th_birthday", "run_id": "745b2e8846ad0112"}}, {"id": "b9", "pause_after_ms": 1100, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I've started reading the small print on everything. Mostly to check my own warranty.", "type": "punchline", "source": {"set": "chris_57th_birthday", "run_id": "745b2e8846ad0112"}}, {"id": "b10", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "smug", "gesture": "small gesture", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.7, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Cathy's planned the party: the guests, the food, and my speech.", "type": "tag", "source": {"set": "chris_57th_birthday", "run_id": "745b2e8846ad0112"}}, {"id": "b11", "pause_after_ms": 1100, "performance": {"expression": "smug", "gesture": "lean in", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 1.0, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Apparently I'm grateful.", "type": "closer", "source": {"set": "chris_57th_birthday", "run_id": "745b2e8846ad0112"}}], "metadata": {"beat_count": 11, "punchline_count": 4, "total_duration_ms": 62126, "word_count": 141, "assembled_from": "audition pipeline sets in sets/*.json (generator template-v0-offline; comic materia